Z||000000||LT1 Chop Top||07-17-2001||06:20 PM||||These pics were taken at the Fiero Round-up 5 here in San Antonio a few weeks ago.  One guy had this sweet stock 87 GT, so we decided to park them together for a great photo op.  It isn't very often you see a blue Fiero, let alone two side x side!  It is a great before/after of what my Archie Chop Top USED to be.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/chp1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/chp2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/chp4.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/chp8.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/chp11.jpg"> <P>||||reg||1
