Z||000010||Cheever2||07-17-2001||09:45 PM||||Joel: those pics alone are a good promotion for the show.  I still want to come out to one of your club meetings to see those fine machines.<P>Did the event organizers mention the dates for next year?  I have to work when month-end falls on a weekend, so the original dates of April 7-8 would have worked for me (I had a room reserved until the change).<P><BR>||||reg||6
Z||000011||LT1 Chop Top||07-18-2001||11:19 PM||||Here is an engine pic for ya KissMyss...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/chp12.jpg"> <P>I believe that the LT1 has stock manifolds......is that right, Archie??<P>Interior pics can be seen here: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/008383.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/008383.html</A> <BR>This is about all I will do on my own, unless I find a deal on a PISA dash...I think that would look good.<P>What do you mean pics in standard resolution??  I use JPEG for all my wall paper (win98).  Email me and Ill convert some for you!<P>SWANY, I am 6'2", and fit well, and so did Archie.  The seats were shallowed out about an inch to compensate for the chop.  I say go for it!  The rims are 17" TSW "Blades" which I believe are discontinued.<P>Cheever, I don't know when Round-up 6 will be.  If you plan to come to a meeting, be SURE to let me know so I know which one to bring!<P>Don't forget my web site, w/ some movies of the Chop Top <A HREF="http://ucsub.colorado.edu/~pattons/Home15.html" TARGET=_blank>http://ucsub.colorado.edu/~pattons/Home15.html</A> <P>||||reg||1
Z||000012||b lo 0||07-19-2001||12:38 AM||||I remember that car-you're the 2nd owner, right?  If I recall correctly, Archie built the car, sold it, and the guy who bought it sold it for about $19k.  Damned sweetest fiero I ever saw- I have an mpeg file from the first owner's website of an at-speed driveby-low res, but sounds AWESOME!!!  Email me if anyone wants the vid.  Kudos, LT1 for having the money I wanted (and the car) and to Archie for building such a fine machine.<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="1">'85 GT (in progress)<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.angelfire.com/ga3/audioimagery/ice.gif">      <BR>White Lightnin!  (NOT moonshine, for all you hillbillies!)</FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000013||LT1 Chop Top||07-19-2001||12:46 AM||||B lo O,<P>I am the second owner AFTER the conversion, with Archie being the first.  In total, I believe I am at least the 4th owner of the car over its entire existance.  The Vid you have is from my web site (see above link).  I put the car up for sale because I bought a new house and I have 5 vehicles and could use the extra space.  I am not at all a motivated seller, but $ does talk.||||reg||1
